[block
  'ORD-0041-series-bundle-rust'
  [ref
    'EMS'
  [/ref]
  [elab
    [ref
      'ORD-0040'
    [/ref]
    'the claim and the refusal this bundle runs'
    [rwk[/rwk]
    [mand
      [neq[/neq]
    [/mand]
    [ctx
      [go
        [switch[/switch]
      [/go]
    [/ctx]
    [rsn[/rsn]
  [/elab]
  [ref
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/ref]
  [ctx
    'the Regent, 2026-11-22, CO-2: move it now. we need to move it little by little, otherwise we will not ever retire JS'
    '.guidelines/.decisions/README.md, 2026-11-22'
  [/ctx]
  [ctx
    'the skill calls an installed glyph and refuses by name where none is installed, J4 b of 2026-11-21'
    '.guidelines/.orders/INTAKE-JS-EXIT.md, section 3'
  [/ctx]
  [tgt
    'bundling into a series moves to the Rust binary: the plugin hands --bundle into a series to an installed glyph of its own version, and the coherence of ORD-0040 holds every Order the plugin bundles there'
  [/tgt]
  [ins
    'have glyph-plugin.js run an installed glyph for --bundle into a series, found by GLYPH_BIN or the place the install writes, with the flags it was given'
  [/ins]
  [ins
    'refuse by name, with nothing written, where no glyph is found or the one found answers another version'
  [/ins]
  [ins
    'add --version to the binary, which answers the engine version and nothing else'
  [/ins]
  [ins
    'state in the bundle command that a series bundle runs the installed glyph, and that several Orders may be open at once'
  [/ins]
  [cnst
    'glyph-cli.js keeps its --bundle, the reference the command line oracle records, until the JS leaves'
  [/cnst]
  [cnst
    'no hash of the snapshot moves; no crate enters'
  [/cnst]
  [cnst
    'npm run check and npm run check:rust green'
  [/cnst]
  [cmp
    'the plugin'
    'a series bundle through glyph-plugin.js written by the Rust binary, its manifest carrying relates, and the two refusals by name, each seen failing before the code'
    [ctx[/ctx]
    [cnst[/cnst]
  [/cmp]
